 <h2 className="guide-section__title">7. Operations Workspace Dashboard</h2>
 <p>
 The Operations Workspace provides a unified view of visitor management activity.
 Access depends on your workspace role — team members see their personal queue, while
 supervisors see the full operations dashboard with all lists and metrics.
 </p>

 <h3 className="guide-section__subtitle">Workspace Roles</h3>
 <table className="field-table">
 <thead>
 <tr>
 <th>Role</th>
 <th>What You See</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody>
 <tr>
 <td><strong>Workspace Team Member</strong></td>
 <td>
 Your personal task queue ("My Queue") and personal task lists. You can
 view and work on tasks assigned to you.
 </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td><strong>Workspace Supervisor</strong></td>
 <td>
 The full Operations Dashboard including all visit lists, all task queues
 across teams, and summary metrics for plant-wide visitor activity.
 </td>
 </tr>
 </tbody>
 </table>

 <h3 className="guide-section__subtitle">Reading the Dashboard (Supervisors)</h3>
 <p>
 The Operations Dashboard is designed to give you a real-time picture of plant visitor
 activity. Here is what to look for:
 </p>

 <dl className="definition-list">
 <dt>Today's Scheduled Visits</dt>
 <dd>
 Shows all visits scheduled for today that have not been cancelled, rejected, or
 completed. Use this to anticipate arrivals and ensure all preparation tasks are
 being handled. Sorted by scheduled start time so the next arrival is always at
 the top.
 </dd>
 <dt>Pending EHS Approval</dt>
 <dd>
 Visits waiting for EHS safety review. If this list is growing, it may indicate a
 bottleneck in the approval process. These are sorted by scheduled start so the most
 urgent reviews appear first.
 </dd>
 <dt>Team Task Queues</dt>
 <dd>
 View open tasks filtered by team — Security, EHS, or Operations. Each queue
 shows tasks that are not yet completed or cancelled. Monitor these to ensure no
 team is falling behind on preparation work.
 </dd>
 <dt>All Open Tasks</dt>
 <dd>
 A combined view of all open tasks across every team, grouped by team type. Use
 this for a high-level view of total outstanding preparation work.
 </dd>
 </dl>

 <h3 className="guide-section__subtitle">Dashboard Tips</h3>
 <ul className="tip-list">
 <li>
 <strong>Start of shift:</strong> Check <em>Today's Scheduled Visits</em> to see
 what is coming up and <em>Pending EHS Approval</em> to clear any blocking reviews.
 </li>
 <li>
 <strong>Mid-day check:</strong> Review team queues to make sure fulfillment tasks
 are progressing. Look for tasks still in <em>Pending</em> state that should have
 been started.
 </li>
 <li>
 <strong>End of shift:</strong> Verify that all visitors for the day have been
 checked out via the Visitor Log.
 </li>
 </ul>
 </section>
 );
}
